{"id":"en_dumped-then-claimed-by-the-lycan-king","title":"Dumped, Then Claimed by the Lycan King","titleEn":"Dumped, Then Claimed by the Lycan King","description":"At eighteen, Riley finds herself betrayed by the three Alphas she trusted, all of whom have chosen Chloe over her. Reduced to nothing more than a caged blood bag, she endures captivity until the Blood Moon awakens the dormant power of a true Lycan Queen within her. With her strength revealed, Riley rejects the Alphas who discarded her and begins to forge her own path. The series follows her transformation from a prisoner to a force in her own right, and viewers can follow the episodes on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/68c69041b50b26f9/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/68c69041b50b26f9/cs_CZ/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Serendipity","Revenge","Serendipity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dk0hm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_dumped-then-claimed-by-the-lycan-king_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dk0hm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dumped-then-claimed-by-the-lycan-king_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dk0hm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dumped-then-claimed-by-the-lycan-king_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dk0hm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_dumped-then-claimed-by-the-lycan-king_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (